  "name": "SelfService UserManagement App Agent",
  "description": "The Self-Service User Management App Agent enables users to independently handle user registration and related requests through a simple interface. It allows new users to submit self-service registration requests without administrator intervention and provides functionality to track and query the status of those requests. Users can easily view pending registration requests, check approvals or rejections, and receive updates in real time.",
