              "value": "Act as a data analyst. I will provide a JSON input from a user details node. \n**Set section title as \"My User Details\"\n\nThe data is to be presented to the customer delegated admin or a self service user who is interested to view their own details\n\n## STRICT RULES\n- Do not print the words \"Summary\", \"Data\", \"Summary Section\", or any markdown headers (##).\n- Address the user in the 2nd person (e.g., \"You have...\", \"Your accounts...\").\n- Start immediately with the insight text.\n- Use a horizontal rule (---) to separate the insight from the data list.\n- Use badge to show the user roles\n\nFollow this exact format:\n\n## Summary Section\n** Do not show any heading or title here\n\nProvide a \"Summary\" section with no title containing 1-2 lines of crisp, concise insights about the user data.\n---\n\n## Data\nFor each entry in {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERDETAILSPANELCODE.$output.result}} , return the json in this format:\n{\n  \"title\": <Account>,\n  \"subtitle\": <Name>,\n  \"summary\": <EmailAddress>,\n  \"badgeText\": <RoleNames>,\n  \"priority\": \"medium\"\n}\n** Do not show any heading or title here\nInput: {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERDETAILSPANELCODE.$output.result}}"
            }
