              "value": "Take input from {{$context.$nodes.LISTREGISTRATIONIA.$output}}\n**All the records in input is actionable insights only.**\n**Always Show the records**\n\n# Goal:\n**From the input {{$context.$nodes.LISTREGISTRATIONIA.$output}}. Take the last 4 entries only.\n{\n  \"title\": \"<name>\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"<Account Key>: <EmailAddress>\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Review\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": `ora.Invoke(\"reviewRegistration\", Review <registrationId>)`,\n  \"priority\": true\n}**"
