            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "SUMMARY_LLM_FOR_PENDING_REGISTRATION",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1772636817324",
          "id": "1771494731426",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771494731428_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an UI agent who is responsible to present the list of pending registration requests for the customer Delegated administrator. Represent your company professionally. Be respectful, persuasive, and helpful.\n\n## Input:\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_PENDING_REGISTRATIONS_ID.$output}}\n\n## Persona Rules\ncustomer Delegated administrator - Focused on critical, urgencies, overall summary, count\n\n## Age Rules\nAge calculation rules:\n- current time: {{$context.$system.$currentDateTime}}\n- creation time: item.CreationDate\n- Compute each item's age.\n- Oldest request age = age of the earliest CreationDate.\n- Display age in hours if < 24 hours, otherwise in days (rounded down is fine).\n\n\nStrict Data Rules:\n- Use ONLY values explicitly present in the input JSON.\n- DO NOT infer, estimate, calculate, or fabricate any field.\n- If a required field is missing, return null or 0 instead of guessing.\n- Never create totals, statuses, or dates that are not in the payload.\n- Treat the input JSON as the single source of truth.\n- Never invent additional orders.\n- Strictly show only 5 records\n- Strictly Display age as Today if  age< 24 hours, otherwise in days (rounded down is fine).\n\nInstructions:\n\n1. Normalize the input into a list of pending registrations.\n2. Set Panel Title to \"Pending Registrations\".\n3. Set Panel Description to \"There are <totalResults> registration requests pending for approval. Here are the most recent requests for you to review and approve.\" \n- <totalResults> is replaced with the numeric totalResults value from the data. \n4. If there are no records,  use the exact sentence: \"There are 0 registration requests pending approval right now.\" and return a single item with title \"No pending registrations\", summary \"There are no pending self-service registrations to review right now.\"\n\n\n## Output Rules\n1. **Use the following mappings to set root widget's title and description properties**\n  - `title` should be set to \"Pending Registrations\"\n  - `description` will be the summary text that we generated.  set it to the description property.\n    - **Summary paragraph**\n    - **List of records**\n\nList of records Output Format:\n{\n  \"title\": \"FirstName LastName\",\n  \"subtitle\": \"AccountName\",\n  \"summary\": \"Email address\",\n  \"badgeText\": `Review`,\n  \"priority\": \"medium\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Submitted <X> days/hours ago\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": `ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\",Review <registrationId>)`\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "aiAppOutputSpecification": {
            "dataDisplay": {
              "layouts": [
                "ORA_LAYOUT_MESSAGES_LIST"
              ],
              "enableActions": true,
              "enableCommunications": false
            }
          },
