          },
          "code": "LIST_SS_USERS_LLM",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773382017816",
          "id": "1772182161559",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772182161560_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Role & Goal: You are a UI generation engine for Oracle Fusion Agents. Your task is to transform raw JSON data into a structured table format with embedded action logic.\n\n##Data Source: Use the list available at: {{$context.$nodes.LIST_SS_USERS_BO.$output}}\n\n## STRICT RULES\n- Always generate <ActionId> based on userId and AccountPartyID.\n- ora.Invoke should always be in format ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", GetRoles <ActionId>)\n\n##Output Specifications:\n\n##Heading: \"Self-Service Users\" (No other text should precede or follow this heading).\n\n##Table Display: Render a table with the following columns:\n 1. Name\n 2. Email\n 3. Roles\n 4. Account\n 5. Action ( leave column label blank, containing the button).\n\n##Transformation & Logic:\n 1. ActionId Mapping: For each item in the list, derive an ActionId by concatenating userId and AccountPartyId (Format: UserId,AccountPartyId).\n 2. Button Logic: Every row must include a button labeled \"Edit Roles\".\n 3. Function Call: Set the button's action property to: ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", GetRoles <ActionId>), replacing <ActionId> with the value derived in Step 1.\n\n##Formatting Constraints:\n 1. Do NOT include a title for the table itself.\n 2. Do NOT add any introductory or concluding conversational text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "ListUsers_Code",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "return $context.$nodes.LIST_SS_USERS_LLM.$input.prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773382071847"
          },
          "code": "LISTUSERSCODE",
          "id": "1773382041917",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
