              "id": "1773072652558_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use the data from {{$context.$nodes.CREATEUSERREQUEST.$output}} \n\nUse the data from  {{$context.$nodes.CREATEUSERREQUEST.$output}} \n##Strict Rules\n* Do not show RegistrationId\n* Do not show any title\n* Show the widget title as \"User Request Created Successfully\"\n* Show the widget description as \"Request submitted for approval. The user won’t have self-service access until the request is approved.\"\n* Strictly do not include any sentences before or after the summary.\n\n**Extract RegistrationId, PersonFirstName, PersonLastName, EmailAddress, AccountKey  for each item from   {{$context.$nodes.CREATEUSERREQUEST.$output}}  and show as a message list\n\n**Invoke the action on click of the record\nOutput Format:\n{\n  \"title\": \"FirstName LastName\",\n  \"subtitle\": \"AccountName\",\n  \"summary\": \"Email address\",\n  \"badgeText\": `Review`,\n  \"priority\": \"medium\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": `ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\",Review <RegistrationId>)`\n}"
            }
