          "code": "LIST_USER_ROLES_LLM",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1773402445444",
          "id": "1771995833444",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771995833445_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "##Objective: Transform two input lists into a single structured \"Editable Record\" JSON object.\n\n##Strict rules\n* Strictly show the data in record widget\n** Strictly show the summary data as `Select the roles for this user, then select Submit. If you selected no roles, the user will become inactive and won’t be able to sign in.`\n\n##Input Data:\n\n1. All Roles: {{$context.$nodes.LIST_ALL_ROLES.$output.items}}\n\n2. Current Roles:{{$context.$nodes.LIST_USER_ROLES.$output.items}}\n\n3. Variables:\n\n  ActionId = {{$context.$variables.userId}},{{$context.$variables.AccountPartyId}}\n ContactPartyName from {{$context.$nodes.LIST_USER_ROLES.$output}}\n##Output Requirements:\n\n**Root Object: Must have an id property set to updateRole~<ActionId>.\n** Set title to `Edit Roles for <ContactPartyName>`\n** Set summary  to `Select the roles for this user, then select Submit. If you selected no roles, the user will become inactive and won’t be able to sign in.`\n\n**Fields Array: Iterate through every object in All Roles. For each entry:\n\n**label: Use the Meaning field.\n\n**id: Use the LookupCode field.\n\n**type: \"select\".\n\n**options: [{\"value\":\"yes\", \"label\": \"Yes\"}, {\"value\":\"no\", \"label\": \"No\"}].\n\n**value: Set to \"yes\" if the LookupCode matches a RelationshipTypeCd in Current Roles (Note: Ignore underscores in comparison if necessary, e.g., ORACSSACCMGR matches ORACSSACC_MGR). Otherwise, set to \"no\".\n\nConstraint: Return ONLY the raw JSON object. Do not include markdown code blocks, headers, or any conversational text."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "GetRoles_Code",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "return $context.$nodes.LIST_USER_ROLES_LLM.$input.prompt;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773402585435"
          },
          "code": "GETROLESCODE",
          "id": "1773402500249",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
