              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "The output data list is available in {{$context.$nodes.PENDINGREGISTRATIONUPDATE.$output}} \n\n##STRICT RULES\n**Strictly do not show the data as records in list  \n** Strictly do not show any widget description\n** Strictly do not show any summary or description data outside the widget\n** Strictly do not show any subtitle\n** Strictly do not show any date values\n** Strictly do not use any other attributes from the data other than `Name`\n** Strictly do not repeat the sentences or status names\n** UserId is available at {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERIDRESPONSE.$output.result.userId}}\n** AccountPartyID is available at {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERIDRESPONSE.$output.result.accountPartyId}}\n** Always generate <ActionId> based on UserId and AccountPartyID.\n\n\n\n##Transformation & Logic:\nGet the UserId  from {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERIDRESPONSE.$output.result.userId}}  and and AccountPartyId from {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERIDRESPONSE.$output.result.accountPartyId}} \n\n1. Get the actionId from {{$context.$nodes.GETUSERIDRESPONSE.$output.result.actionId}} which will be in format `10001222,1006`\n 2. Function Call: Set the button's action property to: ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", GetRoles <actionId>), replacing <actionId> with the value derived in Step 1.\n\n\n\n<oraInsight>\n{\n  \"title\": \"Edit Roles\",\n  \"actionText\": \"Edit Roles\",\n  \"shortDescription\": \"Edit Roles for user\",\n  \"followUpCommand\": `ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", GetRoles <ActionId>)`,\n  \"priority\": true\n}\n</oraInsight>\neg: ora.Invoke(\"selfservice360\", GetRoles 300100654024956,1006)\n\n##Output Rules\n{\n  \"title\": \"Registration Approved\",\n  \"patternId\": \"messageListWidget\",\n  \"description\":null,\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"<name>'s registration has been approved and is now set up as a self-service user. To grant additional access, select Edit Roles.\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n\n-Strictly do not show any summary or description data outside the widget"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
